<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Inicio | File Uploader</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 1rem;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
            background: #f2f5f9;
            color: #1f2937;
        }

        .card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 520px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            margin-top: 0;
            font-size: 1.7rem;
        }

        p {
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        button {
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            padding: 0.8rem 1.4rem;
            border: 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: #dc2626;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background: #b91c1c;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main class="card">
        <h1>
            Bienvenido
            <%= user?.username || user?.name || user?.email || 'Usuario' %>
        </h1>
        <p>Ya puedes empezar a subir y organizar tus archivos.</p>

        <form method="POST" action="/auth/logout">
            <button type="submit">Cerrar sesión</button>
        </form>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
